  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Saving the Saint Lucia Racer</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">to support conservation efforts in Saint Lucia for the Critically Endangered Saint Lucia racer by implementing key actions identified in the species Conservation Action Plan 2015-2024. The Saint Lucia racer is arguably the worlds rarest snake. With a population of less than fifty individuals, restricted to a single 9.4 hectare islet, the species is at high risk of extinction from invasion by nonnative predators and stochastic events.</narrative>
  </description>
